<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 单题引擎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>以步骤连接解题、批改、教学与出题</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E9E62' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>已实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={400} viewBox='0 0 1140 400'><rect x='0' y='24' width='200' height='64' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='100' y='62' font-size='20' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>题目</text><line x1='200' y1='56' x2='262' y2='56' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M262 56 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='272' y='14' width='300' height='84' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='422' y='46' font-size='19' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>AI 解题流水线</text><text x='422' y='74' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>Solver → Verifier → Formatter</text><line x1='572' y1='56' x2='634' y2='56' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M634 56 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='644' y='10' width='250' height='92' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='769' y='46' font-size='19' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>结构化参考解析</text><text x='769' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>步骤 · 知识点 · 难度</text><line x1='894' y1='56' x2='946' y2='56' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M946 56 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='956' y='0' width='184' height='52' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1048' y='32' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>AI 改题</text><rect x='956' y='60' width='184' height='52' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1048' y='92' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>手把手教学</text><rect x='956' y='120' width='184' height='52' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1048' y='152' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>AI 出题</text><path d='M1048 172 q0 60 -120 78 L700 250' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='6 5'/><text x='880' y='232' font-size='14' fill='#00A9B5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>新题再次进入解题流水线校验</text><rect x='0' y='180' width='330' height='72' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='165' y='210' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>学生手写作答 + 笔迹时间线</text><text x='165' y='236' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>步骤批改与过程复盘</text><line x1='330' y1='216' x2='420' y2='216' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M420 216 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#00A9B5'/><rect x='430' y='180' width='330' height='72' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='595' y='210' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>错题与题库</text><text x='595' y='236' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>步骤错因标定 · 查找 · 题单 · 组卷</text><rect x='0' y='300' width='1140' height='92' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='570' y='336' font-size='21' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>AI 解题是单题功能的基石，结构化步骤是其他单题功能共用的基础</text><text x='570' y='372' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>已有解析的题目可以复用解析；后续批改、教学、出题都围绕这份步骤结构展开</text></svg><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>一条主链路 + 一条回流：新题生成后重新进入流水线校验；学生手写作答与笔迹时间线汇入步骤批改与过程复盘，再沉淀到错题与题库</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §1</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 22 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>